  "summary": "<p>President Donald J. Trump returns to Michigan today to visit the General Motors Proving Ground in Milford and celebrate the roaring comeback of American auto manufacturing under his leadership. Since taking office, President Trump has ignited an automotive renaissance — onshoring production, restoring factory jobs, and making vehicles in Michigan again. Record Investments. Record Sales. [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/07/made-in-michigan-again-president-trumps-trade-agenda-is-supercharging-american-auto-manufacturing/\">Made in Michigan Again: President Trump’s Trade Agenda Is Supercharging American Auto Manufacturing</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
